      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/54/1076",
      "text": [
        " اَلصَّلاَةِ فَقَالَ «نَعَمْ قَدْ أَوْمَأَ اَلنَّبِيُّ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ فِي مَسْجِدٍ مِنْ مَسَاجِدِ اَلْأَنْصَارِ بِمِحْجَنٍ كَانَ مَعَهُ » قَالَ حَنَانٌ وَ لاَ أَعْلَمُهُ إِلاَّ مَسْجِدَ بَنِي عَبْدِ اَلْأَشْهَلِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1076 - Hanan ibn Sadeer asked him: \"Can a man gesture while praying?\"\nImam (as) said: \"Yes, the Prophet (sw) gestured in one of the mosques of the Ansar with a Muḥjan that he had with him.\"\nHanan said: \"And I do not know except that it was the mosque of the Banu Abd al-Ashhal.\""
        ]
      }
